### 1) 200 OK - liste av deltagere
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere
Api-Key: hemmelig-noekkel-123

### 2) 401 Unauthorized - mangler nøkkel
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere

############ GET /api/deltagere/{mobil} ############

### 3) 200 OK - deltager finnes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere/12345678
Api-Key: hemmelig-noekkel-123

### 4) 401 Unauthorized - ugyldig nøkkel
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere/12345678
Api-Key: feil-noekkel

### 5) 404 Not Found - deltager finnes ikke
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere/00000000
Api-Key: hemmelig-noekkel-123

############ POST /api/deltagere ############

### 6) 201 Created - ny deltager (Location-header + melding). Gir 409 hvis kjørt to ganger.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Api-Key: hemmelig-noekkel-123

{
  "fornavn": "Lise",
  "etternavn": "Hansen",
  "mobil": "11223344",
  "passord": "hemmelig",
  "kjonn": "kvinne"
}

### 7) 401 Unauthorized - mangler nøkkel
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "fornavn": "Lise",
  "etternavn": "Hansen",
  "mobil": "55667788",
  "passord": "hemmelig",
  "kjonn": "kvinne"
}

### 8) 400 Bad Request - ugyldig input (mobil for kort)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Api-Key: hemmelig-noekkel-123

{
  "fornavn": "Lise",
  "etternavn": "Hansen",
  "mobil": "123",
  "passord": "hemmelig",
  "kjonn": "kvinne"
}

### 9) 409 Conflict - mobil 12345678 er allerede påmeldt
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Api-Key: hemmelig-noekkel-123

{
  "fornavn": "Ola",
  "etternavn": "Nordmann",
  "mobil": "12345678",
  "passord": "hemmelig",
  "kjonn": "mann"
}